open("README.md","w",encoding="utf-8").write('<p align="center">\n  <img src="docs/banner.png" alt="zeltraxCrack" width="100%">\n</p>\n\n<p align="center">\n  <b>zeltraxCrack</b> - Minecraft Fabric client for 1.21 / 1.21.1\n</p>\n\n---\n\n## Bilgi / Information\n\n- Minecraft: Fabric 1.21 (1.21.1 ile de acilir / also loads on 1.21.1)\n- ClickGUI tusu / key: `P`\n- Komut oneki / command prefix: `@`\n- Modulu baglamak icin ustune orta tik / middle click a module to bind it\n- Surum / version: V15\n\n## Gereksinimler / Requirements\n\n- Fabric Loader + Fabric API (1.21)\n- Java 21+\n\n## Kurulum / Install\n\n1. Actions sekmesinden en son yesil calismanin **Artifacts** bolumunden `zeltraxCrack` dosyasini indir.\n2. Zip\'ten `zeltraxCrack.jar` dosyasini cikar ve `mods` klasorune koy.\n3. Eski surum jar dosyalarini `mods` klasorunden sil.\n\n## Derleme / Build\n\n```\n./gradlew build\n```\n\nCikti / output: `build/libs/zeltraxCrack.jar` (Java 21 gerekir). GitHub Actions her push\'ta otomatik derler.\n\n## Ozellikler / Features\n\n- ElytraTarget, ElytraHelper, Aura, AutoTotem ve cok sayida savas / hareket / gorsel modulu\n- Yeniden tasarlanmis ClickGUI ve ozel ana menu\n- Zeltrix HUD paketi: Watermark, TargetHud, Keybinds\n- Ozel acma / kapama / menu sesleri\n\n## Krediler / Credits\n\nBu proje GPL-3.0 lisansli [ThunderHack-Recode](https://github.com/Pan4ur/ThunderHack-Recode) (pan4ur) tabanlidir.\n\n- [meteordevelopment](https://github.com/MeteorDevelopment) - orbit\n- [ladysnake](https://github.com/Ladysnake) - satin\n- [0x3C50](https://github.com/0x3C50) - renderer\n\n## Lisans / License\n\nGPL-3.0. Kaynak kodu bu lisans kosullariyla dagitilir.\n')
